      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just so exhausting. every morning i wake up and the first thing i feel is this crushing dread knowing i have to face it all again. if there's no way to fix it, and the only way to find peace is to just... stop fighting... then it feels like there's no real difference between staying here and just giving up on everything for good. do you really think just letting go is better than the constant pain?",
